{"ref":"BDB, צֶאֱצָא","hw":"צֶאֱצָא","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">צֶאֱצָא</span>]</big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Job 27:14\" href=\"/Job.27.14\">Jb 27:14</a></sup> only pl., <strong>issue, offspring, produce (</strong>Nö<sup> ZMG 1886, 725</sup> comps. <span dir=\"rtl\">ضِئْضِئٌ</span> <em>origin, root, stock</em><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>offspring</em> of men, abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַצֶּאֱצָאִים וְהַצְּפִעוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 22:24\" href=\"/Isaiah.22.24\">Is 22:24</a>; elsewhere only <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 2\" href=\"/Isaiah.2\">Is 2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 3\" href=\"/Isaiah.3\">3</a> and Job: cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">צֶאֱצָאֵי מֵעֶיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 48:19\" href=\"/Isaiah.48.19\">Is 48:19</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">זַרְעֲךָ</span>); sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">צֶאֱצָאַי</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 31:8\" href=\"/Job.31.8\">Jb 31:8</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">צֶאֱצָאֶיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 5:25\" href=\"/Job.5.25\">5:25</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">זַרְעֲךָ</span>), <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 44:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.44.3\">Is 44:3</a> (‖ <em>id.</em>); <span dir=\"rtl\">צֶאֱצָאָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 27:14\" href=\"/Job.27.14\">Jb 27:14</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּנָיו</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">צֶאֱצָאֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 21:8\" href=\"/Job.21.8\">21:8</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">זַרְעָם</span>), <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 61:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.61.9\">Is 61:9</a> (‖ <em>id.</em>), <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 65:23\" href=\"/Isaiah.65.23\">65:23</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>produce</em> of earth, sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">תֵּבֵל וְכָל־צֶאֱצָאֶ֑יהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 34:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.34.1\">Is 34:1</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">הָאָרֶץ וְצ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 42:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.42.5\">42:5</a>.","next":"BDB, מוֹצָא","prev":"BDB, יָצִיא"}